      "side": 1,
      "message": "In general I\u0027m fine with this change but I just want to throw something out there and see what you think.\n\nInstead of adding onGet*Swizzle virtuals we just add one virtual:\n\nvirtual const ColorTypeInfo* getColorTypeInfo(SkColorType, const TextureInfo\u0026) const \u003d 0;\n\nThen all these queries that are just reading data off of ColorTypeInfo can use the same virtual without having to add new ones to the backends each time.\nFor example:\n\nskgpu::Swizzle Caps::getReadSwizzle(SkColorType colorType, const TextureInfo\u0026 info) {\n    const ColorTypeInfo* ctInfo \u003d this-\u003egetColorTypeInfo(colorType, info);\n    if (!ctInfo) { return failure_value; }\n    return ctInfo-\u003efReadSwizzle;\n}",
